WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
I think the place I feel most at home is the kitchen

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.580
My grandma taught me to cook

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.500
Nice work, Pipetka. Way to be late on the first day

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.480
I'm sorry I'm late. I couldn't help it

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.680
A three-headed beast ate my homework

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.440
These are not the girls we used to know

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.020
Yeah, you know, evolution

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.040
Since you love cakes, I wanted to bake for you

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.280
I guess I kind of love you

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.440
You gotta face it, dude. She's out of our league

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.420
It's considered class two obesity

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.700
Have you ever tried to lose weight, Dad?

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.080
All my life, kid

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.720
Watch out, Clara, or he'll eat you

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.500
Yeah, Puffy'll eat anything. Even sisters

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:51.080
The issue isn't in the stomach. It's right here

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:53.760
So what is he, a rabbit?

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:56.420
It's not so bad when you have motivation
